UPDATE platforms SET description = CASE
  WHEN COALESCE(description, $xw$$xw$) = $xw$$xw$ THEN $xw$Note (2026-11-19): Hy4 Flash (hy4-flash), announced 2026-11-16, is a separate model from Hy4. Tencent's launch post says the context length is up to 1 million tokens and that inputs are multimodal. OpenRouter lists a 1,048,576-token window and says the model accepts text and images and returns text. Tencent's launch post lists about $0.070 input, $0.281 output, and $0.003 cached input per 1M tokens. Tencent Cloud's pricing page, updated 2026-11-19, lists $0.07 input, $0.281 output, and $0.003 cache per 1M tokens, and says inference fees are 50% of that list price until 12:00:00 on 2026-11-30 (Beijing time), then return to the list price. OpenRouter's tencent/hy4-flash page, checked 2026-11-19, shows $0.035 input, $0.1405 output, and $0.0015 cache read per 1M tokens, and labels them 50% off. That OpenRouter page does not state an end date. The launch post also says Hy4 Flash is free on WorkBuddy until 2026-11-30, and 50% off standard pricing on Tencent Cloud TokenHub until that date. The launch post does not give a clock time for the WorkBuddy window.$xw$
  ELSE description || $xw$ Note (2026-11-19): Hy4 Flash (hy4-flash), announced 2026-11-16, is a separate model from Hy4. Tencent's launch post says the context length is up to 1 million tokens and that inputs are multimodal. OpenRouter lists a 1,048,576-token window and says the model accepts text and images and returns text. Tencent's launch post lists about $0.070 input, $0.281 output, and $0.003 cached input per 1M tokens. Tencent Cloud's pricing page, updated 2026-11-19, lists $0.07 input, $0.281 output, and $0.003 cache per 1M tokens, and says inference fees are 50% of that list price until 12:00:00 on 2026-11-30 (Beijing time), then return to the list price. OpenRouter's tencent/hy4-flash page, checked 2026-11-19, shows $0.035 input, $0.1405 output, and $0.0015 cache read per 1M tokens, and labels them 50% off. That OpenRouter page does not state an end date. The launch post also says Hy4 Flash is free on WorkBuddy until 2026-11-30, and 50% off standard pricing on Tencent Cloud TokenHub until that date. The launch post does not give a clock time for the WorkBuddy window.$xw$
END, "updatedAt" = now() WHERE slug = $xw$tencent-hy4$xw$ AND COALESCE(description, $xw$$xw$) NOT LIKE $xw$%Hy4 Flash (hy4-flash)%$xw$;

