  ELSE description || $xw$ Note (2026-11-19): Hugging Face's 2026-11-16 post says Inference Providers now send language-model requests through OpenRouter. OpenRouter picks a provider from live price, speed, and reliability, and retries on another provider if the first one fails. Image, video, and audio generation stay on Hugging Face Inference Providers and do not go through OpenRouter. The post says the bill is the provider's price with no Hugging Face markup. Custom provider API keys no longer work for these language-model requests. The post says PRO users get $2 of credits a month, and Team and Enterprise organizations get $2 per seat.$xw$
END, "updatedAt" = now() WHERE slug = $xw$hugging-face$xw$ AND COALESCE(description, $xw$$xw$) NOT LIKE $xw$%language-model requests through OpenRouter%$xw$;

